          <div class="row" role="row"><span role="rowheader">You look at</span><span role="cell" data-h="Timeline editors">a timeline</span><span role="cell" data-h="Video as code">a terminal and code</span><span role="cell" data-h="AI generators">a prompt box</span><span role="cell" data-h="Manul" class="us">your film, before and after</span></div>
